1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Hi everyone!

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Excited to share my latest full-stack project: NexBrief.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Welcome to NexBrief — India's first dedicated daily IT newsletter platform.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Let's start by exploring the landing page of the application.

5
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:44,000
If you attempt to sign in with an unregistered email, the system will prompt you to create an account first.

6
00:00:45,000 --> 00:01:22,000
To register, simply enter your details. A secure 6-digit verification code will be sent to your email to activate your account.

7
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Entering an incorrect password will block the login attempt, ensuring secure access control.

8
00:01:42,000 --> 00:02:18,000
If you forget your password, you can securely reset it using a verification code sent to your registered inbox.

9
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:28,000
Once verified and updated, you can log in to your account with your new credentials.

10
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:44,000
Welcome to the Dashboard — a modern, glassmorphic interface featuring curated IT, Education, and World News.

11
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:54,000
Clicking on any news card opens a modal displaying full details and a direct link to the original source.

12
00:02:55,000 --> 00:03:02,000
I know we rarely have time to log in daily just to search for and read the latest tech updates.

13
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:09,000
To solve this, registering on the platform automatically activates your daily morning newsletter subscription.

14
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:14,000
Every single morning at exactly 7:00 AM IST, the latest news is delivered directly to your inbox.

15
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:32,000
The email presents the headlines and bulleted summaries so you can stay fully informed in just 2 to 5 minutes.

16
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:41,000
If you prefer reading on the dashboard and want to stop the daily emails, you can pause your digest from your settings.

17
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:52,000
Alternatively, you can easily unsubscribe directly from the link provided at the bottom of the emails.

18
00:03:53,000 --> 00:04:04,000
Let's look at the Admin Panel. Admins have a comprehensive overview of active subscribers and past digests.

19
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:11,000
From here, admins can manually trigger and send digests to all subscribers with one click.

20
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:27,000
Admins also have the privileges to make other users admins or permanently delete accounts.

21
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:49,000
Security first: all passwords are encrypted and securely stored, so you can sign up with complete peace of mind.

22
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:54,000
If you like this project, please star the GitHub repository, share this post, and join NexBrief today!

23
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:57,000
Thank you for watching!
